<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-TNT to sell Union to Brierley.</title>
<headline>RTRS-TNT to sell Union to Brierley.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport group TNT Ltd said on Tuesday it had agreed to sell its 50 percent stake in Union Shipping to Brierley Investments Ltd, which already owns the other 50 percent.</p>
</text>
